{"id":"e7c4e1881f3fc819","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-relative-K-complexity.md","title":"Relative K Reducibility Bounds Both Complexities","display":"thm-relative-K-complexity — Relative K Reducibility Bounds Both Complexities","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-relative-K-complexity","aliases":["43-thm-relative-K-complexity"],"display":"thm-relative-K-complexity — Relative K Reducibility Bounds Both Complexities","depends_on":["[[43-df-relative-K-red]]","[[43-df-complexity-red]]","[[43-thm-relative-K-conditional]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Corollary 13.7.5","source_printed_pages":"363","source_pdf_pages":"383","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-relative-K-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-relative-K-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-K-complexity — Relative K Reducibility Bounds Both Complexities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea3f18feeaa80989\" href=\"?note=ea3f18feeaa80989\" title=\"43-thm-relative-K-conditional\">43-thm-relative-K-conditional</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 13.7.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"363"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"383"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；归约与复杂度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rK}\">\\(\\mathrm{rK}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\to B\\le_C A\\land B\\le_K A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\to B\\le_C A\\land B\\le_K A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>草稿该推论的第二个不等号和常数排版有误；正确结论由有界分支程序后接描述机器直接推出，两个复杂度均按同一方向比较。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Corollary 13.7.5；印刷页 363，PDF 页 383。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-relative-K-red","status":"resolved","id":"1ec9f1619fc70e88","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-relative-K-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-relative-K-conditional","status":"resolved","id":"ea3f18feeaa80989","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-relative-K-conditional]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-relative-K-red","status":"resolved","id":"1ec9f1619fc70e88","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；归约与复杂度见 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；归约与复杂度见 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-relative-K-red","status":"resolved","id":"1ec9f1619fc70e88","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{rK}$ 采用 [[43-df-relative-K-red]] 的同名符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rK}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\to B\\le_C A\\land B\\le_K A.","display":true}],"bytes":1375,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-relative-K-complexity]] — Relative K Reducibility Bounds Both Complexities"}],"outgoing":["1ec9f1619fc70e88","9d68ed64bfec741d","ea3f18feeaa80989"]}